  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおきな　ひとみから　サイコパワーをあびせて　あいてを　うごけなくする。みかけによらず　きしょうは　あらい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "커다란 눈동자에서 사이코 파워를 발산하여 상대를 움직일 수 없게 한다. 겉보기와 다르게 성질이 사납다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會從大大的眼睛放出精神力量讓對手無法動彈。有別外表，性格非常粗暴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon immobilise ses adversaires grâce à l’énergie psychique qui émane de ses grands yeux. Il est beaucoup plus violent qu’il n’en a l’air.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es macht Gegner bewegungsunfähig, indem es Psycho-Kräfte über seine großen Augen freisetzt. Entgegen seinem Äußeren ist es ziemlich brutal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Baña al rival con el poder psíquico que emana de sus grandes ojos y lo inmoviliza. A pesar de su aspecto, posee un temperamento feroz.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Immobilizza l’avversario con il potere psichico che emette dalle grandi pupille. Dall’aspetto non si direbbe, ma ha un’indole violenta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It immobilizes opponents by bathing them in psychic power from its large eyes. Despite its appearance, it has a vicious temperament.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大きな　瞳から　サイコパワーを浴びせて　相手を　動けなくする。見かけによらず　気性は　荒い。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大大的眼睛会放出精神力量使对手无法动弹。与外表不同，性格很凶暴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Baña al rival con el poder psíquico que emana de sus grandes ojos y lo inmoviliza. A pesar de su aspecto, posee un temperamento feroz.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いろとりどりの　フリルの　すきまからサイコパワーを　ほうしゅつしてじそく２００キロで　しっそうする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "형형색색의 프릴 사이사이로 사이코 파워를 방출하며 시속 200km로 질주한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會從鮮豔褶邊的縫隙間釋放出精神力量，藉此以時速２００公里的速度狂奔。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son énergie psychique émane des interstices situés entre ses volants colorés. Il peut courir à une vitesse de 200 km/h.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Über die Lücken zwischen seinen farbenfrohen Rüschen setzt es Psycho-Kräfte frei. Es kann eine Geschwindigkeit von bis zu 200 km/h erreichen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Emite energía psíquica por los huecos entre sus volantes multicolor y alcanza los 200 km/h en carrera.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il potere psichico che emette dagli spazi tra le balze colorate del corpo gli permette di correre alla velocità di 200 km/h.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
